      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated Brazil Gov Procurement & Bidding Radar (PNCP API + MCP Server) Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nExtracts, filters, and enriches live Brazilian government public tenders (Pregão Eletrônico, Dispensa - Lei 14.133) from the official PNCP API with item-level pricing, ME/EPP flags, and LLM-ready RAG Markdown briefs.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/b2b-gov-procurement-pncp-radar](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/b2b-gov-procurement-pncp-radar)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: b2b-gov-procurement-pncp-radar** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "53d65594-2c47-5388-b503-ca166abe5fb1",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
